  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p><strong>About our brand and products:</strong><br>Our products are built for people who love being outdoors—whether you're hiking, skiing, traveling, or spending time on the water. We focus on combining functionality, quality, and clean design so you can stay connected without worrying about dropping or damaging your device.<br><br></p><p><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong><br>As an affiliate, you earn <strong>15% commission on every sale</strong> you generate. You’ll also unlock <strong>bonus rewards</strong> as you reach higher performance levels based on the number of sales you drive. The more you sell, the more you earn.<br><br></p><p><strong>How to promote us:</strong><br>You’ll receive a <strong>unique discount/affiliate code</strong> to share with your audience. We encourage promotion on <strong>TikTok, Instagram, and Facebook</strong>, especially through authentic content. Show how you use the product in real situations—out hiking, skiing or on the water—where keeping your phone safe is essential.<br><br></p><p><strong>What makes us different:</strong><br>We prioritize real-life usability. Our gear is tested for movement, weather, and everyday adventures. Unlike generic accessories, Holdmate Gear is designed specifically for active environments where safety and convenience matter most.<br><br></p><p><strong>Other information:</strong><br>We value creators who build trust with their audience. The best results come from genuine use and creative storytelling. Show your lifestyle, integrate the product naturally, and grow with us long-term.</p></div>",
